## Final Judgement
The key insight from the fact-check is that Hunter Biden served as Board Chairman of World Food Program USA, a U.S.-based nonprofit that supports the United Nations World Food Programme (WFP). The Nobel Peace Prize was awarded to the UN WFP itself, not to its affiliate. The claim explicitly states he was chairman of "the Nobel Peace Prize winning World Food Program," which refers to the UN agency. The evidence clearly shows he held no such position with the UN WFP; his role was limited to the separate supporting organization. Therefore, the claim is false.

